  },
  "differences_from_donor": [
    "Clips are retargeted to the Gunner skeleton (idle-delta recipe); 23 Snake-only nodes (face, lips, tongue, bandanna, ClavicleC, LegC) are dropped; Miihead and the finger tip nodes stay at the Gunner idle; Visibility is the Gunner idle's.",
    "The grenade is created with ItemModule::have_item and thrown / dropped through exported item calls instead of Snake's item-backed article 13 (its native callbacks read Snake's params and status ids).",
    "The grenade is constrained to haver on every status entry of the move (the Gunner's own item hand is the left one); the Gunner's right forearm is its arm cannon, so the grenade sits at the cannon end.",
    "Hold walk / dash speeds are the Gunner's own attributes (the common item-shoot code reads the fighter's params), not Snake's.",
    "Ear close is triggered by polling the pulled grenades once per frame instead of by the item's link event (same three conditions; at most one frame later).",
    "Fuse 150 comes from the bridge when Snake is not in the match.",
    "Snake's CYPHER_FALL jump lock (his up special) is not ported.",
    "No voice line: the donor move has none."
  ],
